    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see a \"new path\" when the deficit is so huge. i've spent my whole adult life building a specific vision, and now that it's dead, everything else feels like just noise. it feels like i'm just dragging around a corpse of a life. when you look at the sheer amount of energy and time required to start from zero again... it just feels like a losing game. like, why keep playing a game you've already lost?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
